second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Kensett?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 38, \"text\": \", of which is land and 0.56% is water.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 39, \"end\": 144, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 1,791 people, 699 households, and 445 families residing in the city.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 145, \"end\": 215, \"text\": \"The population density was 1,008.4 people per square mile (388.5/km²).\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 216, \"end\": 294, \"text\": \"There were 778 housing units at an average density of 438.0/sq mi (168.8/km²).\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 295, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"The racial makeup of the city was 70.24% White, 24.29% Black or African American, 0.17% Native American, 0.37% Asian, 2.40% from other races, and 2.57% from two or more races.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 471, \"end\": 531, \"text\": \"4.02% of the population were Hispanic or Latino of any race.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"start\": 532, \"end\": 576, \"text\": \"There were 699 households out of which 29.6%\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 117, \"text\": \"] As of the census [ 5 ] of 2000 , there were 1,791 people , 699 households , and 445 families residing in the city .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01\", \"start\": 118, \"end\": 197, \"text\": \"The population density was 1,008.4 inhabitants per square mile ( 389.3/km 2 ) .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01\", \"start\": 198, \"end\": 290, \"text\": \"There were 778 housing units at an average density of 438.0 per square mile ( 169.1/km 2 ) .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01\", \"start\": 291, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"The racial makeup of the city was 70.24 % White , 24.29 % Black or African American , 0.17 % Native American , 0.37 % Asian , 2.40 % from other races , and 2.57 % from two or more\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 36, \"text\": \"There are 800 males and 991 females.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 37, \"end\": 117, \"text\": \"The median age of the male population is 34.4 and the female population is 41.8.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 118, \"end\": 185, \"text\": \"There are approximately 895 births each year and around 715 deaths.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 186, \"end\": 313, \"text\": \"The race breakdown of the population in Kensett varies per year, but currently 1,745 are one race and 46 are two or more races.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 314, \"end\": 388, \"text\": \"Of the 2,500 people who live in Kensett, there are 515 under 20 years old.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 389, \"end\": 488, \"text\": \"The sex breakdown of the 20 years old and younger population in Kensett is 255 male and 260 female.\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"start\": 489, \"end\": 494, \"text\": \"If...\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 94, \"text\": \"Home | City of Kensett Arkansas Skip to main content Welcome to Kensett , have a blessed day !\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d03\", \"start\": 95, \"end\": 683, \"text\": \"Contact Us Today 's weather : Scattered clouds 84°/58° City of Kensett Arkansas Home Community About Us Calendar of Events Medical Facilities Recent News Schools Worship Government Boards & Commissions Planning & Zoning City Hall City Manager City Clerk Code Compliance Ordinances Code Enforcement Court Court Calendar & Dress Code Procedures & Fines Financial Reports & Budgets Annual Budget Financial Reports/Audits Financial Transparency Human Resources Application Process Employment Opportunities Mayor & Council Mayor Council Open Records Public Information Request Residents Alerts\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kensett\", \"scope\": \"as of the census of 2000\", \"claim\": \"As of the census of 2000, the population of Kensett was 1,791.\", \"answer\": \"1,791\", \"quote\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 1,791 people, 699 households, and 445 families residing in the city.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kensett\", \"scope\": \"population\", \"claim\": \"The population of Kensett was 1,791 as of the 2000 census.\", \"answer\": \"1,791\", \"quote\": \"] As of the census [ 5 ] of 2000 , there were 1,791 people , 699 households , and 445 families residing in the city .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0063-1f86861e0cc0:d02\", \"card_id